## 3.1 Separate the public website from the administration dashboard

The administration dashboard must not appear on the public homepage.

The administration dashboard must have a dedicated route:

`/admin`

Requirements:

- Public visitors see only the public website.
- The public homepage must not display the admin dashboard.
- Admin controls must not appear publicly.
